.TH LIRIA 1 "November 2026" "SDE" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
liria \- the SDE file manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B liria
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIURI\fR|\fIPATH\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Liria browses and organizes the files and folders of your computer, its
drives and the network. Its window has tabs in the title bar, Back,
Forward, Up and Refresh, an address bar and a search box, a short command
bar (New, Cut, Copy, Paste, Rename, Share, Delete, Sort, View and More) and
a navigation pane with Home, the Trash, the pinned folders, the drives and
the network.
.PP
The Home page shows Quick access (only the folders and files you pinned),
the drives with how full they are, network locations and the recently used
files.
.PP
The address bar takes paths and network addresses: \fB\\\\server\\share\fR,
\fBsmb://\fR, \fBsftp://\fR, \fBftp://\fR, \fBdav://\fR, \fBdavs://\fR,
\fBnfs://\fR, IP addresses and computer names. They are opened with GIO and
GVfs (the package gvfs-backends); a server that wants a password asks for
it in Liria's sign-in window.
.PP
One Liria runs per session: \fBliria\fR opens a new window of the running
Liria. Liria is also the session's \fBorg.freedesktop.FileManager1\fR, the
file manager that web browsers ask to show a downloaded file.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-select
Show the given files selected in their folders.
.TP
.BR \-w ", " \-\-new\-window
Open a new window (Liria always does).
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-tabs
Open the locations as tabs of one window (the default).
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-no\-default\-window
Start without a window when no location is given.
.TP
.BR \-g ", " \-\-geometry =\fIW\fBx\fIH\fR
The size of the window.
.TP
.BR \-q ", " \-\-quit
Quit the running Liria.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-desktop
Accepted for compatibility; SDE draws its own desktop.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show the version.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show the options.
.SH KEYS
Ctrl+N new window, Ctrl+T new tab, Ctrl+W close the tab, Ctrl+Tab next tab,
Ctrl+Shift+N new folder, F2 rename, Alt+Enter properties, Alt+Left, Alt+Right
and Alt+Up go back, forward and up, Backspace back, Ctrl+L or Alt+D the
address bar, Ctrl+E or Ctrl+F the search box, F5 refresh, Delete to the Trash,
Shift+Delete delete permanently, Ctrl+A select all, Ctrl+Z undo, Ctrl+H hidden
items, Ctrl+mouse wheel or Ctrl+plus and minus the icon size, F11 full screen.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/sde/liria.conf
The preferences: layout, icon size, sorting, hidden items, the sections of
the Home page and the navigation pane.
.TP
.I ~/.config/sde/liria-quick-access
The pinned folders and files, one location per line.
.TP
.I ~/.config/sde/liria-servers
The recently opened servers (never a password).
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/sde/liria-views
The layout and sorting of the folders whose view you changed.
